62b\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0642\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0643\\u0645\\u0627 \\u0623\\u0646\\u0647 \\u064a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645 \\u0637\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0628\\u0633\\u0637\\u0629 \\u0641\\u0649 \\u062a\\u0648\\u0636\\u064a\\u062d \\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629.<\\/span><\\/p>\"}','/images/portfolio/portfolio-banners/bottom_banner_tharaaa-Bottom-Banner--1.jpg','[\"\\/images\\/portfolio\\/portfolio-carousel\\/Tharaa-Portfolio-Banner-3.png\",\"\\/images\\/portfolio\\/portfolio-carousel\\/Tharaaa-Portfolio-Banner-2.png\",\"\\/images\\/portfolio\\/portfolio-carousel\\/Tharaaa-Portfolio-Banner-1.png\"]','{\"en\":\"<h2><b>Design Concept<\\/b><\\/h2><p><span>The design team at Smart Touch designed the website of Tharaa Real Estate Investment Company through the use of purple colour in the design. The purple colour reflects sophistication and elegance. It is the colour of kings and princes, and it is a smooth and flowing colour.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span>The white colour was chosen to design the internal pages of the website and the black colour of the writing was chosen, so that there was a consistency of colour and eye comfort when reading.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span>The development team developed the website with the latest technology and prepared the website to be compatible with all devices of smartphones and Android.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<h2><b>\\u0641\\u0643\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0635\\u0645\\u064a\\u0645<\\/b><\\/h2><p><span>\\u0642\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0635\\u0645\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0641\\u0649 \\u0633\\u0645\\u0627\\u0631\\u062a \\u062a\\u0627\\u062a\\u0634 \\u0628\\u062a\\u0635\\u0645\\u064a\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0648\\u0642\\u0639 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0625\\u0644\\u0643\\u062a\\u0631\\u0648\\u0646\\u064a \\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0643\\u0629 \\u062b\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0