\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0645\\u062a\\u0627\\u0632\\u0629.\"}','/images/portfolio/portfolio-banners/main_banner_Banner_Exectuive-Suit1.png','/images/portfolio/portfolio-banners/thumb_banner_thumbnail_Executive-Suit.png','{\"en\":\"<h2>Overview<\\/h2><p>Located in Busaiteen, Bahrain; Executive Suites is a world-class development that features highly finished apartments which are finished with high-quality materials and excellent craftsmanship.<br>The 13-story building is designed by award-winning MGAEC architects, Mohammed Al Gharib where you can see the splendour of the design in every inch and corner.<br>With exceptional panoramic views of the sea, Executive Suites project apartments are designed using high-quality materials that follow high specifications where special attention has been given to the quality of lighting, fixtures and fittings.<br>The development redefines luxury living and promotes comfort through its large-scale and modern amenities that don\\u2019t only offer residents a luxurious stay but also ensure their needs are all met.<\\/p><h2>Background<\\/h2><p>Smart Touch was assigned to undertake the creation of Executive Suites eye-catching logo and brochure design that presents all the required information about the project clearly and beautifully.<br>The task main goal was to design a professionally designed logo to create a professional brand and exceptional layout that highlights the different aspects of the project.<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<h2>\\u0638\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0629<\\/h2><p>\\u064a\\u0642\\u0639 \\u0630\\u0627 \\u0625\\u0643\\u0632\\u064a\\u0643\\u0648\\u062a\\u064a\\u0641 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u0633\\u064a\\u062a\\u064a\\u0646\\u060c \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u062d\\u0631\\u064a\\u0646\\u061b\\u0648\\u0647\\u0648 \\u0639\\u0628\\u0627\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0646 \\u062a\\u0637\\u0648\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0648\\u0649 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0645\\u064a\\u06