\u062a\\u0648\\u0631\\u064a\\u062f \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u062f\\u0648\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0635\\u0646\\u0627\\u0639\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u062f\\u064a\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0645\\u0648\\u0638\\u0641\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0648\\u0641\\u0631\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0645\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u062d\\u062a\\u0631\\u0641 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0630\\u064a\\u0646 \\u064a\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u0648\\u0646 24\\/7 \\u0644\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0645\\u0639 \\u0623\\u0641\\u0636\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0646\\u062a\\u062c\\u0627\\u062a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0623\\u064a \\u0648\\u0642\\u062a \\u0645\\u0636\\u0649.\"}','/images/portfolio/portfolio-banners/main_banner_Banner_Kits.jpg','/images/portfolio/portfolio-banners/thumb_banner_Thumbnail_KITS.png','{\"en\":\"<h2>Overview<\\/h2><p>At Kooheji Industrial Tools Supply, your safety is their first priority. For over 50 years now and Kooheji Industrial Tools Supply has been working in full swing to in the Kingdom of Bahrain to provide a product that ensures customers safety and maintain the best position not only with best quality but with the best competitive price as well.<br>An independent family establishment, Kooheji Industrial Tools Supply staff and sales team are working 24\\/7 to serve the customers with best ever products and services.<\\/p><h2>Background<\\/h2><p>Smart Touch was assigned to undertake the creation of Kooheji Industrial Tools Supply brand identity that will position the company among well entrenched competitors.<br>All brand identity items were created starting from the logo design, Letterhead, A4 Folder, A3 and DL size envelope, Business cards, receipt vouchers and stamps, all of which will help in moving forward with the firm\\u2019s competitive position strategy.<\\/p>\",\"ar\":\"<h2>\\u0646\\u0638\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0629<\\/h2><p>\\u0641\\u064a \\u